        "id": 1416371
      },
      "writtenOn": "2020-08-10T19:08:06Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "If it\u0027s per-SPM, then we don\u0027t want it to be per-tipc-device either. I\u0027ve made it per-device to land it though. We can change it once it matters.",
      "parentUuid": "0d4714ae_08748cda",
      "revId": "5d0c105ebfec56e16bc01c3500d5b28db31467d6",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889",
