      "writtenOn": "2020-08-07T19:53:36Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "How do you share memory for read only access with trusty using this? While you should obviously not be allowed to give trusty write access to a read-only file, we may want to restrict sharing to read access only even if the sender has write access.",
      "revId": "5d0c105ebfec56e16bc01c3500d5b28db31467d6",
